## RECOMMENDATION
**Add to 8%**

The thesis is Strengthening (pipeline +37% YoY, 45X PTCs preserved, field performance validated, capital structure materially improved) and there is no stumble. Per the decision matrix, Strengthening thesis + No stumble → Add.

**Condition that would change this recommendation next quarter:** If Q3 revenue does not show a step-up to at least $35–40M (consistent with the doubling cadence required to reach the low end of guidance), or if backlog declines again without a specific large order announcement, downgrade to Hold and reassess the H2 bridge credibility. A second Cerberus milestone extension beyond October 31, 2025 would also trigger a reassessment toward Trim.

